Today I wake up early.
This is a pleasant February morning.
My flat in Kochi is very peaceful.
The sun is rising now.
I get up from the bed.
I go to the bathroom.
I brush my teeth.
Then I wash my face.
After that, I get dressed.
I walk to the kitchen.
I am making a cup of coffee now.
I boil the water.
The coffee smells good.
I pour the hot coffee into the cup.
I sit near the window.
I am drinking the coffee slowly.
I look outside.
The birds are flying.
I am preparing for the day today.
I feel very happy.
